abstract: >-
  Technical case study of the XZ Utils backdoor (CVE-2024-3094), covering
  maintainer trust, release-tarball manipulation, build-stage payload injection,
  liblzma runtime hooking, the OpenSSH dependency path, ecosystem exposure,
  detection hypotheses, remediation, and defensive lessons.
